## Case: err-enum-payload
id: "av.parity.1083.err-enum-payload"
tags: ["av-language-parity", "plan-1083", "types"]
links: ["PLAN-1083"]
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "main.at"

```auto
enum ParseError {
    UnexpectedEnd
}
fn parse(s Str) !int {
    if s == "" {
        return Err(ParseError.UnexpectedEnd)
    }
    return Ok(42)
}
fn main() {
    let r = parse("")
    is r {
        Ok(n) -> print(n)
        Err(e) -> {
            is e {
                ParseError.UnexpectedEnd -> print("unexpected end")
                else -> print("other error")
            }
        }
    }
}
```

