## Case: positional-ctor-family
id: "av.parity.1083.positional-ctor-family"
tags: ["av-language-parity", "plan-1083", "types"]
links: ["PLAN-1083"]
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "main.at"

```auto
type Point {
    x int
    y int
    fn sum() int { return .x + .y }
    static fn origin() Point { return Point(0, 0) }
}
fn build(v int) Point {
    return Point(v, v * 2)
}
fn main() {
    let p = build(3)
    print(f"build=${p.sum()}")
    let o = Point.origin()
    print(f"origin=${o.sum()}")
}
```

