## Case: list-elem-method
id: "av.parity.1083.list-elem-method"
tags: ["av-language-parity", "plan-1083", "types"]
links: ["PLAN-1083"]
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "main.at"

```auto
type Item {
    v int
    fn get() int { return .v }
    static fn new(v int) Item { return Item(v) }
}
fn total(items List<Item>) int {
    var t = 0
    for it in items {
        t = t + it.get()
    }
    return t
}
fn main() {
    let xs = [Item.new(1), Item.new(2), Item.new(3)]
    print(f"total=${total(xs)}")
    print(f"idx1=${xs[1].get()}")
}
```

