## Case: method-value-family
id: "av.parity.1083.method-value-family"
tags: ["av-language-parity", "plan-1083", "types"]
links: ["PLAN-1083"]
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "main.at"

```auto
type Cube {
    v int
    fn get() int { return .v }
    fn twice() int { return self.get() * 2 }
    static fn new(v int) Cube { return Cube(v) }
}
fn apply(b Cube) int { return b.get() }
fn make(v int) Cube { return Cube.new(v) }
fn main() {
    print(apply(Cube.new(7)))
    print(make(8).get())
    let b = Cube.new(6)
    print(b.twice())
}
```

